DESLOP includes a vendored excerpt of the Karpathy Guidelines
(the four behavioral gates), derived from Andrej Karpathy's public
observations (https://x.com/karpathy/status/2015883857489522876)
and the community packaging at forrestchang/andrej-karpathy-skills
(declared MIT in that project's SKILL.md frontmatter).

The four gates are quoted. The Rails / Vue / SQL detectors, scoring
model, CLI, WASM ABI, and remaining skill doctrine are original to
this repository.

This is a derivative work, not a verbatim clone of that plugin pack.
